{"id": "crh-2026-07-31-026", "date": "2026-07-31", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 31, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["crh"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["capacity_consolidation", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["record", "decline"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "CRH reports results for second quarter of 2026", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/CRH-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Ireland/US: </strong>CRH recorded revenues of US$10.8bn in the second quarter of 2026, up by 6% year-on-year, driven by demand and contributions from acquisitions. It recorded a net income of US$1.5bn, 13% higher than the same period of 2025, and an earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortisation (EBITDA) of US$2.6bn. It said that cement volumes declined by 2%, impacted by adverse weather in certain", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21065-crh-reports-results-for-second-quarter-of-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-31-027", "date": "2026-07-31", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 31, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.75, "keywords": ["record", "increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Titan releases financial results for first half of 2026", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/Titan-Concrete-Mixer-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Greece: </strong>Titan recorded sales of €1.42bn in the first half of 2026, representing an increase of 7% year-on-year, which is attributed to higher sales in all regions supported by overall increased volumes in its core products. Earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortisation (EBITDA) increased by 9% to €312m. Cement sales volumes reached 9.5Mt, up by 7% year-on-year.</p>\n<p>For", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21064-titan-releases-financial-results-for-first-half-of-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
